                                                "sense_id": "a0df2f0c-e75e-3fb8-89ac-fab4aefddbe4",
                                                "text": "In a Diſpnœa, the breath is thick, vvithout noiſe or anhelation, and vvith leſs trouble."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2da2cdd3-3d9e-4b74-887d-f046c9744124",
                                                "sense_id": "a0df2f0c-e75e-3fb8-89ac-fab4aefddbe4",
                                                "text": "During August the tumor again grew rapidly, causing dyspnœa, constipation and general malaise."
